{"title":"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c1096b974265b67279a3fd5d80c67aa261d955e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{X_n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"41\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/6/6b6fa203f3648fc16c187dc06897894cd9cbbd8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{Y_n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"36\" height=\"18\" /> denote two sequences of integers defined as follows:\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/b/cebce4cef53ec8891f6b19b9e15609f8f67e3ce4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_0=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/9/4c98f37726f1b237003a06d40752524a28e99f47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"55\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/f/79f9ae578208dd5fd22233a74eb9958b7fa123db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_{n+1}=X_n+2X_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"159\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a27887235fc6fe223896299960f50abedf4113f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n=1,2,3,\\dots),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" /></center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/79793a5127f0c02da1cd1496fc8a96c10a26232a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_0=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0e33be65971d1a5f4e92726ac4f5928d8c6ab59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_1=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/7/0e713f61302bc1d06796c423e76fcc2e456b6df5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_{n+1}=2Y_n+3Y_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/8/0382bde36fe67f5296e632643ceb5d774545d3b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n=1,2,3,\\dots)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />.</center>\n<p>Thus, the first few terms of the sequences are:\n</p>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/3/423b49eb7fcf22e80c66be8b01f2cbdd2d9c34fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X:1, 1, 3, 5, 11, 21, \\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"172\" height=\"16\" />,</center>\n<center> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/3/89343c5c6c83f02fb1b692cc7d7d845c7d56e3fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y:1, 7, 17, 55, 161, 487, \\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"207\" height=\"16\" />.</center>\n<p>Prove that, except for the \"1\", there is no term which occurs in both sequences.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can look at each sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3349fea5212f8fc8982c96aba09ec5d6b4127d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/64683f315744c851898c8d65dace1a8aa31b93ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />,</center>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/64683f315744c851898c8d65dace1a8aa31b93ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dots$\" width=\"19\" height=\"2\" />.</center>\n<ul><li>Proof that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> repeats <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3349fea5212f8fc8982c96aba09ec5d6b4127d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />:</li></ul>\n<p>The third and fourth terms are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3349fea5212f8fc8982c96aba09ec5d6b4127d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />. Plugging into the formula, we see that the next term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/1/96191e55b657ce979275abac4a3ac2a1dfe2f0f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11\\equiv 3\\bmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />, and plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get that the next term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/9449bcb98af72e50e747a6cd68181cc49bb7204b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13\\equiv 5\\bmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />. Thus the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> repeats, and the pattern is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/7/1779159cb05b8a0c30d5c80c167eeab2626ca7a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3,5,3,5,\\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Proof that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> repeats <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3349fea5212f8fc8982c96aba09ec5d6b4127d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />:</li></ul>\n<p>The first and second terms are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3349fea5212f8fc8982c96aba09ec5d6b4127d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" />. Plugging into the formula, we see that the next term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/d/f4d9f572b56c3745d76ceeef49639fc52599ff05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17\\equiv 1\\bmod{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />, and plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get that the next term is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/8/748857c1781708571e8e8076c6e91b3883b82967.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23\\equiv 7\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"105\" height=\"12\" />. Thus the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> repeats, and the pattern is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/3/583e0baff76f4b294d9d5d8a530193a97aae7abf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1,7,1,7,\\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>Combining both results, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/8/5f8e5cbb6204882df1cf17cfe4b308d485af8056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/d/72d7bd848eb1706ce2aad9424995a3d7178636d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"17\" /> are not congruent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/4/3349fea5212f8fc8982c96aba09ec5d6b4127d6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\bmod{8}$\" width=\"45\" height=\"12\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/d/38d6cdb41d02847efb6246e1d3a287701edac562.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\geq 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/6/7463046a942212d0677d4f8b4c1ec7be5b1cb0bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j\\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. Thus after the \"1\", the terms of each sequence are not equal.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can solve this problem by finding a particular solution for each linear recurrence.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4b758f8192e3a406247391e1baa81ef740e90b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_{n+1} - X_n - 2X_{n-1} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"18\" /> with characteristic polynomial\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/f/43f68762ceecfbb7e716dd547fa706cce494f42b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X^2 - X - 2 = (X - 2)(X + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"244\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/e/c3e6f23ac938314d9945f1babd8e395ff609fb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X = -1, 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/1/4d15b485f9ca7f054a69cd470dcbc6b76f8ed80e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_n = A(2)^n + B(-1)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>After plugging in to find the particular solution:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/e/f7e29f2df37414142e69883f502127c61d0c5b1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_0 = 1 = A + B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/0/1d070869140a2f96968ecc709d620ea6c811a70e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1 = 1 = 2A - B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"142\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/a/25a84a788ff3ee6e1a66ad662f7b409657241f32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/4/0d4173d8db1ea08597fa52f1864779a7dc6472da.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"54\" height=\"38\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/e/30eb48376fdc2b3149b62d84a01dbe32b4656491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_n = \\frac{1}{3}(2)^n + \\frac{2}{3}(-1)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Doing the same for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/489a3cdd1bb02859eb3894729c544fefeffa658c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" />, we get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/0/c105ed8e4ba0c497ca4a6010cc2a0839b3dac00d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_n = 2(3)^n - (-1)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"156\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>We know they're equal at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6fc266463b33c8b1c079a50909f3fd03ed5ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, so let's set them equal and compare.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/2/962a5cc16532ec3341922ab67d35a84cee0aa8bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(3)^n - (-1)^n = \\frac{1}{3}((2)^n + 2(-1)^n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"273\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94ba3fe6b74dfbd6f15f272bd53e4458cb4d8f29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(3)^n - 3(-1)^n = (2)^n + 2(-1)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"255\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/f/65fc0911585ea516801df48a76d5aa8c1610e6b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(3)^n - 2^n = 5(-1)^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>By induction, we know in general that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/2/d22a9374133841aa28eaa1c996c50d0e1ace3c99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\alpha + 1)^n &gt; \\alpha^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/7/167097887ead3f43f20973f13274961e69647b77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha, n &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/1/e716c616feb014194533b81e5a50ce1a33cd6882.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6(3)^n &gt; 2^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"86\" height=\"20\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d98ffe996c0f0d3b82b284cba2113439fefea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p>Therefore, the left hand side is always increasing and will never equal 5 again, so equality between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d9b71f24bec81e0e4411b64e51c7ae415fb838.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/489a3cdd1bb02859eb3894729c544fefeffa658c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> only holds when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6fc266463b33c8b1c079a50909f3fd03ed5ffd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 0$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, so they only share 1 term.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(simple)\">Solution 3 (simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d9b71f24bec81e0e4411b64e51c7ae415fb838.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/489a3cdd1bb02859eb3894729c544fefeffa658c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" /> are both positive for all nonnegative integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />. This is since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e5e2212d37e0f988a4a149b3173f26b9cd2fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a2484f4fcf9c11699c809dc6fbf9a622e8347e7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4050d664ce5c92ff00047194b106fe14626543e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e73cfb05d07a227a4ffb1b455ec58e3f21ea699.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> are all positive, and if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/d/74d9b71f24bec81e0e4411b64e51c7ae415fb838.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/c/d2cabd05a8ddc3a9355ad1928d9c2e843b380bf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> is positive then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/f/99f617bf9e426f50970a1df5e5966943d8e2204b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"16\" /> as a sum of two positive numbers is positive, and similarly for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/489a3cdd1bb02859eb3894729c544fefeffa658c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"17\" />. Simple.\n</p><p>Next, consider <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/6/8a682c414958935d633334c76746a951eeaef2c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z_n = Y_n - X_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"113\" height=\"17\" />. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/e/50ea4bee805552c4cecb15a001f247ee692c34f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z_{n+1} = Y_n + Z_n + 3 Z_{n-1} + X_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"261\" height=\"18\" />. Another easy inductive argument like above shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/2/fc2687e4e0b45f8b8e82ba8f0e60bbba1f524ff3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z_n &gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/0247db3d702b5ce6be98f50771750a2723cddcea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. But if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/2/fc2687e4e0b45f8b8e82ba8f0e60bbba1f524ff3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z_n &gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/c/18c81a3f06d058c1e490b0e1324be9d4f5440962.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z_n \\ne 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/9/8591afd78304782c0042542052be58e19e6f93c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_n \\ne Y_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> as desired.\n</p><p><br />\n~ <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ddk001\" title=\"Ddk001\">Ddk001</a>\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO\" title=\"1973 USAMO\">1973 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1973\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1973_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1973 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171443\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.051 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 536/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1617/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 16937/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.056      1 -total\n 65.39%   19.654      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 17.68%    5.313      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n 16.01%    4.811      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:7325:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171443 and revision id 264366. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}